      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَرْدَحَ</span></b>  <i>He went quickly</i> in his walk; <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَرْتَحَ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, rolled.</i> (S, K.) Ex.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَقَطَ مِنَ السَّطْحِ فَتَكَرْدَحَ</span> <i>He fell from the
flat top,</i> or <i>roof,</i> of the house, <i>and rolled.</i>
(As, S.)

